   "en": "<h2>Schedule your free demo now</h2>Discover in 30 minutes what Hrmforce can do for you and your organization. Fill out the form below now, and we’ll contact you within one business day.\n<h2>Request Form</h2>Can’t wait to ask your question? Then contact our consultants.\n\n<strong>T:</strong>\n\n<a href=\"tel:+31888832188\">+31 (0)88 88 321 88</a>\n\n\n<strong>E:</strong>\n\n<a href=\"mailto:service@hrmforce.com\">service@hrmforce.com</a>\n\nWe’re available Monday through Friday from 8:00 a.m. to 6:00 p.m."
